      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-06-04T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Satin Creditcare Network Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 250.25 million in funding from Trishashna Holdings & Investments Private Limited",
      "body": "Satin Creditcare Network Limited announced private placement to issue 3,850,000 fully convertible warrants at an issue price of INR 65 for gross proceeds of INR 250,250,000 on June 4, 2026. The transaction includes participation from Trishashna Holdings & Investments Private Limited at pre issue shareholding of 36.17%  and post issue shareholding of 38.32%. Warrants are fully convertible into equivalent number of Equity Shares of face value of INR 10 each within a maximum period of 18 (Eighteen) months from the date of allotment of such Warrants. Warrant have an exercise price of INR 195. The transaction is approved by board of directors of the company and is subject to approval of Shareholders of the Company, subject to approvals, consents, permissions and/or sanctions, as may be required",
      "keyDevTypeId": "83",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
