      "date": "2026-05-12T11:43:31.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹30.20 (up from ₹16.92 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹15.7b (up 51% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹3.32b (up 79% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 21% (up from 18% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 15%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 26%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 16% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 11% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
